  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="25">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 25</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And ne þearf ænig mynstermunuc ahwar mid rihte fæhðbote biddan ne fahðbote betan; he gæð of his mæglage þonne he gebihð to regollage.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no monk who belongs to a monastery anywhere may lawfully either demand or pay any compensation incurred by vendetta. He leaves the law of his kindred behind when he accepts monastic rule.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
